{
  "source": "Prompts/evaluation-matters-1.mp4",
  "duration": 175.8911875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.42,
      "text": "Imagine you ask an AI for a summary of a critical financial report,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.18,
      "end": 7.76,
      "text": "and it outputs a highly detailed, confident breakdown."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.68,
      "end": 13.62,
      "text": "The numbers look perfect, but they belong to an entirely different company's balance sheet."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 18.68,
      "text": "AI systems generate text with the exact same authoritative tone,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.68,
      "end": 22.76,
      "text": "whether their information is completely accurate or entirely made up."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.22,
      "end": 27.5,
      "text": "Even when there are no factual errors, an answer can still fail your requirements."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.5,
      "end": 30.56,
      "text": "A generated explanation might leave you confused,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.2,
      "end": 34.1,
      "text": "or a proposed schedule might physically clash with reality."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.1,
      "end": 39.14,
      "text": "Because of these missteps, it is tempting to simply ignore AI altogether,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.84,
      "end": 44.26,
      "text": "but leaving that much computational power on the shelf puts you at a severe disadvantage."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.1,
      "end": 49.66,
      "text": "To get the most out of these tools, you need a rigorous system to evaluate their results."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.4,
      "end": 54.24,
      "text": "Every time you generate an answer, you must ask two distinct questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.24,
      "end": 58.42,
      "text": "Is it right? And is it good enough for what I actually need?"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.28,
      "end": 63.22,
      "text": "This board shows the complete process for evaluating an AI answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.94,
      "end": 66.24,
      "text": "First, conduct a fast preliminary check."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.88,
      "end": 70.66,
      "text": "Next, decide if you need to dig deeper and apply specific checks."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.36,
      "end": 74.56,
      "text": "Finally, make a definitive decision on how to use it."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.22,
      "end": 79.24,
      "text": "This reliable process ensures you never blindly trust AI outputs."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 82.38,
      "text": "Let's focus on the quick review process shown here."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.38,
      "end": 86.76,
      "text": "First, read the complete answer. You are responsible for it."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.36,
      "end": 91.54,
      "text": "Next, ensure you comprehend the text, asking the AI to simplify if needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.52,
      "end": 94.9,
      "text": "Then, validate the output against known facts."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.74,
      "end": 99.58,
      "text": "This fast pass catches obvious errors without fact-checking fatigue."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.54,
      "end": 105.46,
      "text": "A quick review is often all you need for low-stakes tasks, like asking for a movie recommendation."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.48,
      "end": 111.7,
      "text": "But a scholarship application, or medical advice, requires much deeper scrutiny."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.7,
      "end": 115.04,
      "text": "This board outlines when to take a closer look."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.84,
      "end": 118.42,
      "text": "For high-stakes tasks, you have three checking methods."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.18,
      "end": 120.9,
      "text": "First, check the AI's sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.9,
      "end": 125.02,
      "text": "Second, challenge the answer by asking for counter-arguments."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.9,
      "end": 129.94,
      "text": "Third, step outside the AI to consult experts or test it yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.8,
      "end": 132.76,
      "text": "Deploy this when failure risks are high."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.5,
      "end": 137.4,
      "text": "Once you complete your evaluation, that process has to culminate in a concrete action."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.22,
      "end": 140.98,
      "text": "As this final board shows, you have three possible moves."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.98,
      "end": 144.06,
      "text": "If the output meets your requirements, use it."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.62,
      "end": 146.12,
      "text": "If it falls short, fix it."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.66,
      "end": 149.68,
      "text": "And if the AI consistently fails, walk away entirely."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.78,
      "end": 155.4,
      "text": "Mastering these moves puts you in charge, preventing the AI from dictating your final product."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.42,
      "end": 158.42,
      "text": "This closing banner summarizes the dynamic."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.2,
      "end": 161.0,
      "text": "The tool answers, you evaluate."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.02,
      "end": 164.94,
      "text": "The machine generates content, but you provide final judgment."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.9,
      "end": 166.54,
      "text": "Review the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 167.16,
      "end": 168.4,
      "text": "Take a closer look when needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.2,
      "end": 170.04,
      "text": "Decide what to do next."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.04,
      "end": 172.28,
      "text": "Your critical judgment is vital."
    }
  ],
